Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 05:00:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] metal: convolve hook opt-in; batched c2c probe documents
 negative result

Per-scale GPU c2r ties/loses (12ms+expansion vs CPU 7ms); batched
numberBatches regresses (B=2: 13.0, B=4: 13.6, B=8: 23.7 ms/plane vs
12.5 serialized). Gate the convolve hook behind MX_METAL_CONVOLVE=1.
Default -mgpu is peak + predict hooks (both neutral-or-better).

